# Project anchor

The working rules for this repo live in one place, shared by Claude Code and Cursor:

- `CLAUDE.md`: what the site is for, how to work on it, the facts rules, the checks.
- `.claude/brain/audience.md`: who visits, what each visitor needs, the 5-second, 30-second and 3-minute tests.
- `.claude/brain/playbook.md`: taste, quality bar, scope rules, writing rules, and what Kamlesh has turned down.
- `.claude/brain/design-system.md`: tokens, patterns, motion and breakpoints as built.

Read CLAUDE.md before any change. The old "Meniscus" multi-page plan is archived in `.claude/brain/archive/` and is not the current design.
